sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant S as STS + MFA
  participant A as Application
  participant T as Tyk Gateway
  participant E as Enterprise PDP
  participant M as Edge PDP (Cerbos)

  Note over U,S: Authentication
  U->>S: Sign in + MFA
  S-->>U: Signed token

  Note over U,M: Authorization
  U->>A: Request + token
  A->>T: Call + token
  T->>T: Validate token (keys, audience, expiry)
  T->>E: AuthZEN request
  E-->>T: Permit (a deny ends the request here)
  Note over T: Looks up mission attributes
  T->>M: AuthZEN request with mission attributes
  M-->>T: Permit, deny, or step-up
  T->>T: Compose (deny-overrides) and log both verdicts

  alt Permit
    T-->>A: Permit, forward request
    A-->>U: Response
  else Step-up required
    T-->>A: Step-up required
    A-->>U: Re-authenticate
    U->>S: Stronger MFA
    S-->>U: New token, retry from step 3
  end
